[{"verse_key":"88:1","translations":[{"text":"大災的消息，確已降臨你了，"}]},{"verse_key":"88:2","translations":[{"text":"在那日，將有許多人，是恭敬的、"}]},{"verse_key":"88:3","translations":[{"text":"勞動的、辛苦的，"}]},{"verse_key":"88:4","translations":[{"text":"他們將入烈火，"}]},{"verse_key":"88:5","translations":[{"text":"將飲沸泉，"}]},{"verse_key":"88:6","translations":[{"text":"他們沒有食物，但有荊棘，"}]},{"verse_key":"88:7","translations":[{"text":"既不能肥人，又不能充飢；"}]},{"verse_key":"88:8","translations":[{"text":"在那日，將有許多人，是享福的，"}]},{"verse_key":"88:9","translations":[{"text":"是為其勞績而愉快的，"}]},{"verse_key":"88:10","translations":[{"text":"他們將在崇高的樂園中，"}]},{"verse_key":"88:11","translations":[{"text":"聽不到惡言，"}]},{"verse_key":"88:12","translations":[{"text":"裡面有流泉，"}]},{"verse_key":"88:13","translations":[{"text":"裡面有高榻，"}]},{"verse_key":"88:14","translations":[{"text":"有陳設著的杯盞，"}]},{"verse_key":"88:15","translations":[{"text":"有排列著的靠枕，"}]},{"verse_key":"88:16","translations":[{"text":"有鋪展開的絨毯。"}]},{"verse_key":"88:17","translations":[{"text":"難道他們不觀察嗎？駱駝是怎樣造成的，"}]},{"verse_key":"88:18","translations":[{"text":"天是怎樣升高的，"}]},{"verse_key":"88:19","translations":[{"text":"山巒是怎樣豎起的，"}]},{"verse_key":"88:20","translations":[{"text":"大地是怎樣展開的。"}]},{"verse_key":"88:21","translations":[{"text":"你當教誨，你只是教誨（他們的），"}]},{"verse_key":"88:22","translations":[{"text":"你絕不是監察他們的，"}]},{"verse_key":"88:23","translations":[{"text":"但誰轉身離去而且不信道，"}]},{"verse_key":"88:24","translations":[{"text":"独一真神將以最大的刑罰懲治誰。"}]},{"verse_key":"88:25","translations":[{"text":"他們必定只歸於我，"}]},{"verse_key":"88:26","translations":[{"text":"他們的稽核，必定由我負責。"}]}]